# working docs that map the auth surface and its known gaps. this repo is
# public: PORTAL_CONTEXT.md is a full threat model of /ops and the client-id
# login, and ARC_FIX_CHECKLIST.md enumerates what is unfixed. neither holds a
# credential, and both are exactly what you would want if you were probing the
# console. keep them local, or move them somewhere private — do not commit them
# here without deciding to.
PORTAL_CONTEXT.md
ARC_FIX_CHECKLIST.md
# the whole-business summary: accounts, hosted state and the list of what is open.
ARC_BUSINESS_CONTEXT.md
# the same, plus every roadmap and architecture doc concatenated, for pasting into
# a model or a notebook. generated; rebuild it rather than editing it.
ARC_FULL_CONTEXT.md

# n8n credentials dropped into the repo by mistake. the repo is PUBLIC and this
# file holds a live n8n API key, which grants full control of the n8n account.
# ignored so no `git add -A` can ever publish it. better still: move it out of
# the repo entirely.
n8n.env
**/n8n.env/

# per-session lists of the files Claude edited, read by scripts/autoship.mjs
.claude/autoship/

